    "description": "This is a PDF app for Android and the best viewer for viewing PDF.\r\n\r\nPDF Reader\ud83d\udcd6\r\nFull screen immersive reading\r\n\r\nView multiple file types\ud83d\udcda\r\nSupport viewing a variety of office documents: pdf, word, excel, ppt, quickly view files\r\n\r\nEdit PDF\ud83d\udcdd\r\nHighlight the key points\r\nAdd strikethrough\r\nAdd underline\r\nBrush marking and signature\r\n\r\nGet permission to read system files\r\nAllows open access to system files, making it easier to view PDF files on your system. Read PDF books and PDF notes on the go with this fast PDF reader.",
